    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udd95 <strong>Download the FREE demo now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/d8fa25909fe061e50b46d61663abb1f6.poster.avif?t=1742651834\" width=610 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/d8fa25909fe061e50b46d61663abb1f6.webm?t=1742651834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/d8fa25909fe061e50b46d61663abb1f6.mp4?t=1742651834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Welcome to Gun Crate Raccoon \u2013 the ultimate gun-switching, crate-collecting, fast-paced arcade shooter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>You were just a hungry raccoon scavenging for some premium trash pizza</strong> when a rogue scientist\u2019s experiment <strong>tore open reality itself</strong>, trapping you in <strong>the Crateverse</strong>\u2014a dimension where crates rain from the sky, each containing a <strong>random, uncontrollable weapon</strong> from across existence. Now, the only way out is <strong>up</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd9d <strong>Climb the ever-rising tower, collect weapons, and fight off chaotic enemies before the void swallows you whole.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/4c94f7545f0955da97d8069ea1ae113a.poster.avif?t=1742651834\" width=610 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/4c94f7545f0955da97d8069ea1ae113a.webm?t=1742651834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/4c94f7545f0955da97d8069ea1ae113a.mp4?t=1742651834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a1 HOW IT WORKS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Crates = Random Weapons!</strong> Pick up crates to increase your <strong>score</strong> and get a <strong>new, unpredictable weapon.</strong> Adapt or die.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Fast-Paced Action!</strong> Jump, dash, and shoot with <strong>precision platforming &amp; combat.</strong><br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Procedurally Generated Chaos!</strong> Every run is <strong>different</strong>, featuring random levels, enemies, and encounters.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Permanent Upgrades!</strong> Unlock new weapons, perks, and abilities <strong>between runs</strong> to push further each time.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Perk Combinations!</strong> Stack abilities that <strong>drastically alter your gameplay</strong>\u2014turn bullets into missiles, create chain explosions, or summon floating turrets!<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Story Mode &amp; Infinite Run Mode!</strong> Experience <strong>short-burst challenges</strong> with time to <strong>upgrade &amp; breathe</strong> in <strong>Story Mode</strong>, or <strong>dive into non-stop madness</strong> in Infinite Run.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Time Attack, Mini-Games &amp; Boss Fights!</strong> More than just shooting\u2014expect <strong>surprises &amp; challenges</strong> along the way!<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Meet Other Reality-Glitched NPCs!</strong> Between runs, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>other unfortunate beings stuck in the Crateverse.</strong> They might help you... or just talk nonsense.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Leaderboards!</strong> Only the <strong>craziest, most skilled raccoons</strong> can climb to the top. Will you be one of them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>No two runs are ever the same\u2014will you master the chaos and escape the Crateverse?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/1532391d972bbbb63d5e1240b247b3a6.poster.avif?t=1742651834\" width=610 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/1532391d972bbbb63d5e1240b247b3a6.webm?t=1742651834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/1532391d972bbbb63d5e1240b247b3a6.mp4?t=1742651834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udd95 <strong>The demo is available NOW\u2014give it a try and wishlist to stay updated!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udd95 <strong>Download the FREE demo now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/d8fa25909fe061e50b46d61663abb1f6.poster.avif?t=1742651834\" width=610 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/d8fa25909fe061e50b46d61663abb1f6.webm?t=1742651834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/d8fa25909fe061e50b46d61663abb1f6.mp4?t=1742651834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Welcome to Gun Crate Raccoon \u2013 the ultimate gun-switching, crate-collecting, fast-paced arcade shooter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>You were just a hungry raccoon scavenging for some premium trash pizza</strong> when a rogue scientist\u2019s experiment <strong>tore open reality itself</strong>, trapping you in <strong>the Crateverse</strong>\u2014a dimension where crates rain from the sky, each containing a <strong>random, uncontrollable weapon</strong> from across existence. Now, the only way out is <strong>up</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd9d <strong>Climb the ever-rising tower, collect weapons, and fight off chaotic enemies before the void swallows you whole.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/4c94f7545f0955da97d8069ea1ae113a.poster.avif?t=1742651834\" width=610 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/4c94f7545f0955da97d8069ea1ae113a.webm?t=1742651834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/4c94f7545f0955da97d8069ea1ae113a.mp4?t=1742651834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a1 HOW IT WORKS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Crates = Random Weapons!</strong> Pick up crates to increase your <strong>score</strong> and get a <strong>new, unpredictable weapon.</strong> Adapt or die.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Fast-Paced Action!</strong> Jump, dash, and shoot with <strong>precision platforming &amp; combat.</strong><br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Procedurally Generated Chaos!</strong> Every run is <strong>different</strong>, featuring random levels, enemies, and encounters.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Permanent Upgrades!</strong> Unlock new weapons, perks, and abilities <strong>between runs</strong> to push further each time.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Perk Combinations!</strong> Stack abilities that <strong>drastically alter your gameplay</strong>\u2014turn bullets into missiles, create chain explosions, or summon floating turrets!<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Story Mode &amp; Infinite Run Mode!</strong> Experience <strong>short-burst challenges</strong> with time to <strong>upgrade &amp; breathe</strong> in <strong>Story Mode</strong>, or <strong>dive into non-stop madness</strong> in Infinite Run.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Time Attack, Mini-Games &amp; Boss Fights!</strong> More than just shooting\u2014expect <strong>surprises &amp; challenges</strong> along the way!<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Meet Other Reality-Glitched NPCs!</strong> Between runs, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>other unfortunate beings stuck in the Crateverse.</strong> They might help you... or just talk nonsense.<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Leaderboards!</strong> Only the <strong>craziest, most skilled raccoons</strong> can climb to the top. Will you be one of them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>No two runs are ever the same\u2014will you master the chaos and escape the Crateverse?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/1532391d972bbbb63d5e1240b247b3a6.poster.avif?t=1742651834\" width=610 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/1532391d972bbbb63d5e1240b247b3a6.webm?t=1742651834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001620/extras/1532391d972bbbb63d5e1240b247b3a6.mp4?t=1742651834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udd95 <strong>The demo is available NOW\u2014give it a try and wishlist to stay updated!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Fast-paced arcade mayhem! Gun Crate Raccoon is a high-speed 2D platformer shooter where every crate gives you a new random weapon. Climb, shoot, and survive in a procedurally generated tower filled with chaotic battles, crazy perks, and non-stop action! Can you dominate the leaderboards?",
